    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "xzd1emu",
      "content": "Non-Timber Forest Produce (NTFP), also called Minor Forest Produce (MFP), is a crucial source of livelihood for tribal communities. The state has established a strong MFP procurement system to ensure fair prices to tribal collectors."
    },
